sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Depositor
  participant AP as Apache and Shibboleth
  participant H3 as H3 web
  participant GL as Globus (prod server)
  participant J as H3 DepositWorkJob (Solid Queue)
  participant FS as /sdr-deposit-staging (NFS)
  participant DSA as DSA
  participant SURI as SURI
  participant MQ as RabbitMQ
  participant RR as Robots Redis

  U->>AP: GET /webauth/login
  AP->>H3: X-Remote-User, X-Groups, X-Orcid-Id headers
  alt browser upload
    U->>H3: upload files (Active Storage)
  else Globus upload
    H3->>GL: GlobusSetupJob: mkdir, allow writes
    U->>GL: transfer files to the per-work Globus directory
  end
  U->>H3: Deposit
  H3->>J: enqueue DepositWorkJob
  opt Globus files
    J->>GL: disallow writes
  end
  J->>J: Contents::Analyzer adds digests and mime types
  alt new work
    J->>DSA: POST /v1/objects (assign_doi)
    DSA->>SURI: POST /identifiers
    SURI-->>DSA: druid
    DSA-->>J: cocina object, version 1 open
    J->>DSA: create registrationWF
  else existing work
    J->>DSA: open version if needed, PATCH /v1/objects/druid with If-Match
  end
  J->>FS: Contents::Stager copies files to druid tree
  opt Globus files
    J->>MQ: sdr.objects.event h3_globus_staged
  end
  J->>DSA: POST versions/current/close
  DSA->>DSA: create accessionWF steps in workflow DB
  DSA->>RR: enqueue accessionWF_start-accession job
  Note over RR: common-accessioning picks up the job, accessioning has started
  Note over MQ,H3: Later: end-accession.completed on sdr.workflow reaches h3.deposit_complete
